Utfier skriuwe: ['Test object'], nije-rigel.
>> a := Objekt nĳ. 

a by: ['item:'] dwaan: { :moment
	eigen moment := moment. 
}.

a by: ['item'] dwaan: { <- eigen moment.
}.

>> today := Momint nĳ sône: ['CEST'], jier: 2026, moanne: 7.
a item: today.
Utfier skriuwe: a item, nije-rigel.
a save-as: ['/tmp/a.bin'].

